        },
        "346_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's more fun being a cat,",
                "but I can't really talk like that."
            ]
        },
        "354_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Besides, it looked like I was gonna lose to ya,",
                "so I had to change back."
            ]
        },
        "362_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Are you the pet Satori",
                "was talking about?"
            ]
        },
        "370_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<t$Yukari >(I think she said it wasn't the cat.)"
            ]
        },
        "378_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I was watching, and listening.",
                "To my Master's gallantry, and your plot!"
            ]
        },
        "386_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You wanna stop the geysers?",
                "Ya better not!"
            ]
        },
        "394_0": {
            "lines": [
                "She's really dangerous, ya know?",
                "She's the most dangerous bird in the underground."
            ]
        },
        "402_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well i am not planing to turn back now!",
                "i have not walked all the way here just to turn back"
            ]
        },
        "410_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<t$Yukari >(Hm, I wonder where our cat went off to?",
                "<l$> It's such a pain when she just suddenly disappears like that.)"
            ]
        },
        "418_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<t$Yukari >(I wish she'd take care to program her own",
                "<l$> shikigami properly. Without any bugs.)"
            ]
        },
        "426_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, if you're gonna go up against that dangerous bird,",
